f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, August to September and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025, August to September came in at 51% of normal on the middle. Grid 25649 had its driest year in 1988, at 53% of normal.</p>"}
